{"id":446,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際教育と探究で学びを深める学園","feature_description":"湘南白百合学園中学・高等学校は、キリスト教精神に基づく学園として、学習の特色、国際教育、探究講座を三本柱にしています。部活動・委員会活動は学年を超えて運営され、仲間との絆や責任感、他者のために奉仕する力を育てます。学びと生活が自然に結びつく点が特徴です。 運動部と文化部の枠組みだけでなく委員会活動もあり、学年を超えた協働が日常になります。","clubs":[{"id":8821,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8822,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8823,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8824,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8825,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8826,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8827,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8828,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8829,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8830,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8831,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8832,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://chukou.shonan-shirayuri.ac.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"